   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">HI all.  See below.  I think this came up before but I can’t remember… Is someone planning to go to JSM and interested in delivering this short course?  It is a good way for us to reach new potential users.<div>See you</div><div>A</div><div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Mar 8, 2016, at 4:19 PM, Peterson, Rick &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ri...@amstat.org</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:10px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Hi Andrew,<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">No problem. I think Partha Lahiri was the one from the committee that originally contacted you about doing a course on Stan. We’ve scheduled this course to be a half-day course on the afternoon of Sunday, August 8. The course will begin at 1:00 p.m. and end at 5:00 p.m. There is a 15 minute beverage break scheduled for 3:15 to 3:30. The instructor can take other breaks if needed. I will ask for specific audio visual needs later, but can you tell me if the audience should bring their own laptops to the course if any programming exercises are planned? The reason I ask now is because if the answer is yes, I’ll need or the convention center to install power strips in the room so everyone can have an outlet to plug into. This can be expensive so we adjust the registration fees to accommodate this added expense.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Also, if you can let me know who from the group that will be doing the course that would be helpful.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">I hope this information helps. If you have any questions, please let me know.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Best regards,<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Rick<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div><div style=\"border-style:solid none none;border-top-color:rgb(181,196,223);border-top-width:1pt;padding:3pt 0in 0in\"><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif\"><span> </span>Andrew Gelman [<a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mailto:gel...@stat.columbia.edu</a>]<span> </span><br><b>Sent:</b><span> </span>Tuesday, March 08, 2016 4:05 PM<br><b>To:</b><span> </span>Peterson, Rick<br><b>Subject:</b><span> </span>Re: JSM Course Title and Abstract<u></u><u></u></span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">Hi, could you remind me of the details of this?  I won’t be the one giving the course, it will be someone from my group.<u></u><u></u></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">Thanks.<u></u><u></u></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">Andrew<u></u><u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div><div><blockquote style=\"margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt\"><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">On Mar 8, 2016, at 3:26 PM, Peterson, Rick &lt;<a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ri...@amstat.org</a>&gt; wrote:<u></u><u></u></div></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div><div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Hi Dr. Gelman,<u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">We’re putting together the marketing material for JSM 2016. Can you send me a title and description for your half-day course?<br><br>Best,<u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Rick<u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Rick Peterson</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Professional Development &amp; Chapters and Sections Manager</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><b