    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">HI all.  See below.  I think this came up before but I can’t remember… Is someone planning to go to JSM and interested in delivering this short course?  It is a good way for us to reach new potential users.<div>See you</div><div>A</div><div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Mar 8, 2016, at 4:19 PM, Peterson, Rick &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ri...@amstat.org</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:10px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Hi Andrew,<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">No problem. I think Partha Lahiri was the one from the committee that originally contacted you about doing a course on Stan. We’ve scheduled this course to be a half-day course on the afternoon of Sunday, August 8. The course will begin at 1:00 p.m. and end at 5:00 p.m. There is a 15 minute beverage break scheduled for 3:15 to 3:30. The instructor can take other breaks if needed. I will ask for specific audio visual needs later, but can you tell me if the audience should bring their own laptops to the course if any programming exercises are planned? The reason I ask now is because if the answer is yes, I’ll need or the convention center to install power strips in the room so everyone can have an outlet to plug into. This can be expensive so we adjust the registration fees to accommodate this added expense.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Also, if you can let me know who from the group that will be doing the course that would be helpful.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">I hope this information helps. If you have any questions, please let me know.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Best regards,<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Rick<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;fo